  Description: "Raymarched metaballs for Specs: up to 8 balls per field melt into one glossy, iridescent surface, drawn by a single shader inside a self-fitting proxy sphere. MetaballField + MetaballSource put goo on anything — fingertips, grabbable orbs, a lava lamp, an assistant orb — with four looks (Bubblegum, Liquid Chrome, Neon Plasma, Lava) and live smoothness, wobble and intensity."
